# 00 — Next Agent Startup — luiz-dk-sveltekit

You are working inside this generated project repository.

Do not rely on prior conversation memory for undocumented project facts. Do not ask for the private Agentic Delivery OS unless the user explicitly provides it. This project contains a client-safe Project Harness Capsule with all required local operating rules.

## Current Phase

Run `python3 scripts/resume_project.py`. The active checkpoint declares the current phase, tasks and next action; it overrides historical bootstrap descriptions.

## Mission

Resume the active checkpoint after reconciling actual Git and filesystem state. On first adoption, validate the capsule, confirm baseline, inspect briefing and define the implementation contract. Do not start product implementation unless the current phase and approved contract allow it.

